{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:23 2026-11-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:23 2026-11-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:23 2026-11-19 HKT</p><p>馬國明再遇當年「安心事件」主角許志安。他表示，未知在演出環節後會否留低睇騷，一切等公司安排。他坦言知道安仔壓軸表演，也知大家想法，但不覺得尷尬：「多年前的事已過去，今日大家一齊幫TVB慶生，絕對不尷尬。」</p><img alt=\"馬國明再遇當年「安心事件」主角許志安強調唔尷尬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7f3b86bb4d83b033fd0365601d489b5e/2026-11/thumbnail_1__8.jpg\"/><img alt=\"馬明心情不錯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17f5ffbbe0cdc07e9f00014851d3df43/2026-11/thumbnail_3__3.jpg\"/><img alt=\"馬明有備而戰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f2a6eebe7e966a271094fcc38089e673/2026-11/thumbnail_7__1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"馬明全程拖住高海寧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d32ab4e13e0c10f3babb77205bbce57f/2026-11/thumbnail_4__1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"仲好風騷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/347fcbf136271a9e289c6bcd1584352f/2026-11/thumbnail_8__0.jpg\"/><img alt=\"許志安壓軸演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/76f3fe7759c22b351318d5e244f68ac3/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-19_at_22_10_22.jpg\"/><img alt=\"馬明離座後又重返。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/56ad7b7991c8219dbb118fa543dac19d/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-19_at_22_14_02.jpg\"/><h2>馬國明台慶大抽獎前夕歸隊</h2><p>不過，在陳展鵬遊戲項目後，馬國明被發現已不在舞台上的小生花旦坐席，沒有與在台上表演的許志安同場。在台慶大抽獎前夕，馬國明才與高海寧雙雙歸隊，準備大抽獎及全台藝員大合照環節。<br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T14:38:45.570317+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":285,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:23:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T17:14:45.406683+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T14:32:08.640468+00:00","content_hash":"f92a2b513d2f7c61ba371bb4eeaf832aeec3c8c080e3a092a25bd47e954a4c9a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}